<title>USA: Thermedics Inc Q1 March 29 net rises.</title>
<headline>Thermedics Inc Q1 March 29 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				    March 29, 1997	March 30, 1996</p>
<p>    Revenues			    $72,057,000	$68,994,000</p>
<p>Income Before Provision</p>
<p>	for Income Taxes		 25,730,000	  8,589,000</p>
<p>    Net Income			   21,966,000	  5,257,000</p>
<p>    Earnings per Share			  .56		  .15</p>
<p>    Weighted Average Shares	  38,956,000	 35,597,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1996 restated to include the acquisition of International Technidyne Corp by Thermo Cardiosystems Inc, a Thermedics affiliate, and accounted for in a manner similar to a pooling of interests.</p>
</text>
